  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">「對角線圍欄」讓各種圍欄都能夠以對角線方式相連。運作方式正如你所預期，所以真的沒什麼好再多說的了。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">其他模組新增的方塊會盡可能動態支援。若有不慎受到影響的方塊，可將其加入 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">diagonalfences:non_diagonal_fences</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 方塊標籤來避免此情況。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">歡迎查看對角線方塊模組系列的其他兩個專案：</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-windows\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Diagonal Windows</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 和 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-walls\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Diagonal Walls</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">與如 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfish-furniture-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MrCrayfish's Furniture Mod</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（作者 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mrcrayfish\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MrCrayfish</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">）和 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/macaws-fences-and-walls\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Macaw's Fences and Walls</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（作者 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Sketch_Macaw</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">）等模組搭配使用，效果絕佳。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ 用戶端與伺服器端皆須安裝</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ 需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric 與 NeoForge 適用）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ 需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric 適用）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ 需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（Fabric 適用）</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若模組支援，即可直接從遊戲內使用模組選單進行設定（需安裝 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（作者 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">），Fabric 環境下需安裝）。請注意，在較舊的 Minecraft 版本中，還需要安裝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若要使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有設定檔均位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，根據設定類型命名為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。並非所有設定類型都存在於每個模組中，甚至可能完全不存在。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/theweatherpony\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">TheWeatherPony</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 在其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fence-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Fence Overhaul</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 模組中提出的原始構想。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/magneticflux_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Magneticflux</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 在其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-panes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Diagonal Panes</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 模組中提供的部分對角線碰撞箱代碼。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 萬分感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/xfacthd\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">XFactHD</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 將 Diagonal Fences 移植至 1.18，貢獻了對角線模型代碼，並在開發過程中提供了全面協助！</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-anvils\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-tridents\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stoneworks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/stoneworks/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mob-plaques\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mobplaques/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bag-of-holding\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bagofholding/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bartering-station\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/barteringstation/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-zoology\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slot-cycler\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/slotcycler/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-shulker-boxes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
